      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KILCOY LASS (7) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (17.31) at Murray Bridge behind RIO HOPE in a Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Has good speed and can quickly clear the pack out wide. Sure to be about the mark. PRETTY ESMAY (1) continued her winning form with another strong run after running them ragged to make it two on end at Murray Bridge over 300m (17.26). Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Can measure up again. ADHANA PHILLIP (5) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fifth (20.37) at this track in a Other. Speedy runner who can find the front with a clear break off the middle. Well placed here and should do much better. BRINDLE BENNY (2) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
